            <h2>Video Advertising</h2>
            <p>All successful businesses have one thing in common: Effective advertising. As the world turns digital, companies that strive for success need an experienced digital marketing agency that uses data to fuel creativity to navigate the digital landscape.</p>
            <h4>Creativity is intelligence having fun. (Albert Einstein)</h4>
            <p>Our Chicago PPC management services include video advertising as well. We will create engaging video advertisements geared toward building your online reputation, increasing your company’s presence, and encouraging word-of-mouth marketing. Alpha Efficiency employs strategic thinking to generate the results you are looking for. We will also refresh your current campaigns in case you are not satisfied with the results.</p>
            <p>Around 70% of consumers claim that they prefer video ads to text ads. By using proven techniques for captivating the attention of internet users and delivering brand stories, our digital marketing agency can help you enjoy the benefits of video advertising - which include:</p>
        </article>
        
        <article class="card-list-cards">
            <div class="card-list-card">
                <p><strong>Conversion rates boost</strong> - from email marketing conversion rates to amazon advertising conversion rates, well-crafted videos can evoke emotions and influence the decisions of your potential customers.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-list-card">
                <p><strong>Increased click-through rates</strong> - Videos allow you to hold the audience's attention for a longer period and represent your products or services in a more engaging way. If you are having trouble getting people on your landing pages, experimenting with this form of advertising could be a game-changer.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-list-card">
                <p><strong>Engaged mobile users</strong> - By implementing subtitles in your videos, our Chicago PPC company can make your advertisements enjoyable to people who are using mobile devices in public places as well.</p>    
            </div>
            <div class="card-list-card">
                <p><strong>More shares on social media</strong> - Since people love sharing interesting videos with their friends, branded videos are one of the most powerful tools in social media marketing. By analyzing the habits of your target audience, Alpha Efficiency can help you publish the right videos at the right time to get more social shares.</p>    
